- The **second sentence and beyond** are citation (they describe a prior method).

When evaluating the percentage of technical content, the minimal technical part (the first sentence) is very small in scope. The phrase "we provide a high-level overview of our proposed algorithms" is a brief statement of the authors' work, but it does not elaborate on the technical details. In contrast, the citation content (the baseline approach) is substantial and detailed.

